{"author":{"id":"1949ffc23f11a8cb4f8c42a45c9ad241b49570df9a18687489e9ea78d87c54a3"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1773170996,"nonce":"BfKyjD02CS45nn00++Cf2VB+FAw=","title":"Network subgraph wiring incorrect: feedback→cell.hidden, missing recurrent loop","message":"createNetworkSubgraph in graphStore.ts has two wiring errors: (1) input_bindings maps feedback → [cell, hidden], but in SimpleStagedNetwork, feedback is a sensory signal concatenated with input before the cell, not the recurrent state. Both input and feedback should route to cell.input. (2) The recurrent hidden state self-loop (cell.output → cell.hidden) is not shown at all. Fix: route both input and feedback to cell.input, and add a self-wire from cell.output back to cell.hidden to represent the recurrence.","files":null}]}